<DIV class="con">
<P class="tit">2023年国际双创实践周——企业课程介绍</P>
<P class="zd"><SPAN>2023-06-09</SPAN><SPAN>审核人：<!--</SPAN><span style="color:red;">审核人参数配置未打开</span><SPAN>-->(已浏览<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1070628979, 12696)</script>)</SPAN></P>
    <div id="vsb_content_2" class="ny"><div class="v_news_content">
<p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0em;"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><strong>2023年国际双创实践周本科生学分课程聘请海外专家和企业专家授课项目申报汇总表</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-indent: 0em;"><span style="font-size: 20px;"></span>&nbsp;</p>
<table height="3485" align="center" data-sort="sortDisabled">
 <tbody>
  <tr height="85" class="firstRow">
   <td width="34" height="85" align="center" valign="middle"><p><strong><span style="font-size: 14px;">序号</span></strong></p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p><strong>课程编号</strong></p></td>
   <td width="98" align="center" valign="middle"><p><strong>申报学院</strong></p></td>
   <td width="245" align="center" valign="middle"><p><strong>中文课程名</strong></p></td>
   <td width="245" align="center" valign="middle"><p><strong>英文课程名</strong></p></td>
   <td width="50" align="center" valign="middle"><p><strong>学分/学时</strong></p></td>
   <td width="100" align="center" valign="middle"><p><strong>可选课专业（也可以是某类专业、工科、理科等）</strong></p></td>
   <td width="80" align="center" valign="middle"><p><strong>先修课程（如没有填“无”）</strong></p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="40">
   <td height="40" align="center" valign="middle"><p>1</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>IC236001</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>通信工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle" style="-ms-word-break: break-all;"><p>职业生涯管理：如何把工作折腾成你想要的样子</p><p><a href="../1174/12770.htm" target="_blank">（点击查看）</a></p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle"><p>Career Management</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>1/16</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>不限专业</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>无</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><br></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="40">
   <td height="40" align="center" valign="middle"><p>2</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>IC236002</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>通信工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle" style="-ms-word-break: break-all;"><p>电信企业的科技创新蝶变<br><a href="../1174/12769.htm" target="_blank">（点击查看）</a></p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle"><p>Technological innovation of telecom enterprises</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>1/16</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>不限专业</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>无</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><br></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="40">
   <td height="40" align="center" valign="middle"><p>3</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>IC236003</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>通信工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle" style="-ms-word-break: break-all;"><p>C++编程实践<br><a href="../1174/12768.htm" target="_blank">（点击查看）</a></p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle"><p>C++ Practical Programming</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>1/16</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>工科</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>修过C++面向对象程序设计课程</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><br></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="40">
   <td height="40" align="center" valign="middle"><p>4</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>IC236004</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>通信工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle" style="-ms-word-break: break-all;"><p>数字孪生和虚拟仿真开发技术<br><a href="../1174/12767.htm" target="_blank">（点击查看）</a></p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle"><p>Digital Twin and Virtual Simulation Development Technology</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>1/16</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>电子信息类/自动化类/计算机类</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>无</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><br></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="40">
   <td height="40" align="center" valign="middle"><p>5</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>IC236005</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>通信工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle" style="-ms-word-break: break-all;"><p>2023新技术应用<br><a href="../1174/12766.htm" target="_blank">（点击查看）</a></p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle"><p>2023 New Technology Application</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>1/16</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>电子信息类/自动化类/计算机类</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>无</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><br></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="40">
   <td height="40" align="center" valign="middle"><p>6</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>IC236006</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>通信工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle" style="-ms-word-break: break-all;"><p>物联网技术设计与实践<br><a href="../1174/12765.htm" target="_blank">（点击查看）</a></p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle"><p>IoT system design and practice</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>1/16</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>工科</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>无</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><br></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="40">
   <td height="40" align="center" valign="middle"><p>7</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>IC236007</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>通信工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle" style="-ms-word-break: break-all;"><p>移动通信网络架构演进<br><a href="../1174/12764.htm" target="_blank">（点击查看）</a></p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle"><p>Evolution of mobile communication network atchitrcture</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>1/16</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>工科、理科</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><br></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><br></td>
  </tr>
  <tr height="40">
   <td height="40" align="center" valign="middle"><p>8</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>IC236008</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>通信工程学院</p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle" style="-ms-word-break: break-all;"><p>光通信技术发展及创新应用<br><a href="../1174/12763.htm" target="_blank">（点击查看）</a></p></td>
   <td align="left" valign="middle"><p>Development and innovative application of optical communication technology</p></td>
   <td align="center" valign="middle"><p>1/16</p></td>
